flowchart LR
    System[System Admin]
    Support[Support Admin]
    Customer[Customer Admin]
    UI[Neumorphic Admin UI]
    Control[Control Backend / Modules]
    Auth[Authorization]
    AuditWriter[Audit Writer]
    AuditDB[(Append-only Admin Audit Store)]
    Streams[(Durable Event Stream)]
    Seg[SegLumberjack\nSanitized correlation only]
    Archive[(Immutable S3 Audit Archive / Checkpoints)]

    System --> UI
    Support --> UI
    Customer --> UI
    UI --> Control --> Auth

    Auth -->|authorized mutation| AuditWriter
    AuditWriter --> AuditDB
    AuditWriter --> Streams
    AuditWriter -->|sanitized event| Seg

    AuditDB -. periodic integrity/archive .-> Archive

    AuditDB -->|RBAC-scoped queries| Control
    Control -->|tables / filters / detail drawer| UI

    Note1[Support audit views never expose message body or attachment content]
    Note2[Impersonation preserves real actor + acting-as subject]
    Note3[Audit DB is authoritative; SegLumberjack is diagnostic]

    AuditDB -.-> Note1
    AuditWriter -.-> Note2
    Seg -.-> Note3
